    DataSource ds = ((DataSource) ctx.lookup("jdbc/hsqldb"));

Now when some database opereations are made, I suggest `ctx` should be closed:

     if (ctx != null) {
         ctx.close();
        }

But [here](https://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/jdbc/basics/sqldatasources.html) `InitialContext` is simpply set to `null`:

    import java.sql.*;
