<p>It seems I created a recursive loop.</p>

<ul>
<li>componentDidMount dispatches action to fetch data</li>
<li>upon receiving the data, it fires success action to store the data in redux state.</li>
<li>a parent react component is connected to redux store and has <code>mapStateToProps</code> for the entry that just changed in the above step</li>
<li>parent renders child components (which is programmatically selected via variable)</li>
<li>the child component's componentDidMount gets called again</li>
<li>it dispaches action to fetch data</li>
</ul>

